  "bodyHash": "daefb2d06cc2a57f",
  "content": "\n\n<p><em>作者更新：</em></p>\n<p>我一切都好，但由於我的重心有所轉移，無法保證會再有更多更新。我非常感謝大家給予的正面回饋，因為我最初製作模組只是為了自己，上傳也只是抱著有人可能會感興趣的心態。但未來究竟如何，誰也說不準。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenhanced-mob-spawners\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></a></p>\n<p><em>新增使用「精準採集」挖掘刷怪籠並取得怪物蛋的功能，以及自訂設定。</em></p>\n<p>+ 可使用精準採集工具挖掘刷怪籠</p>\n<p>+ 右鍵點擊刷怪籠，將根據內部生成的生物種類掉落對應的怪物蛋。</p>\n<p>+ 所有生物有 4% 機率掉落怪物蛋 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>（可在設定檔中修改）</em></span></p>\n<p>+ 在創造模式選單（裝飾品分類）中加入刷怪籠方塊</p>\n<p>+ <strong>可修改刷怪籠的各項數值，例如生成數量、速度與範圍。範例：讓刷怪籠的有效範圍最大達 128 格！（原版為 16 格）</strong></p>\n<p>+ 可透過模組設定檔自訂各種參數</p>\n<p>+ 可透過遊戲內設定選單或紅石訊號來開啟/關閉刷怪籠</p>\n<p>+ 可透過設定檔啟用<strong>有限次數生成</strong>！控制刷怪籠在損毀前最多能生成的生物數量。<strong>（Forge 1.18 不支援此功能）</strong></p>\n<p>+ 可透過設定檔更改所有刷怪籠的預設作用範圍</p>\n<p>+ 可透過設定檔更改刷怪籠方塊的硬度</p>\n<h4><strong>Fabric 與 Forge 設定說明：<br></strong></h4>\n<p>設定檔位於 <span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">.minecraft/config/spawnermod.json<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">。 </span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">true</span>/<span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">false</span> 數值以 <span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">1 = true</span>、<span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">0 = false</span> 表示</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">掉落率介於 0 - 100 之間（整數）</span></span></span></p>\n<p>若您使用的是模組的<em><strong>舊版</strong></em>：設定檔為 <span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">spawnermod.toml</span> 檔案。</p>\n<p>本模組的目標是為原版 Minecraft 的刷怪籠增添更多實用功能。透過讓玩家能夠取得怪物蛋，使移動刷怪籠成為可能，進而完全掌控其內部生成的生物種類。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ArRC2gm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pfTpGCe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/behOrWb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HUbhHmC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Id78jWY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xCQ9NrB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oNgS9Mf.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<p>歡迎自由將其加入任何整合包，但請務必標示出處 :) </p>\n<h4><strong><em>查看我的其他模組：</em></strong></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/well-fed\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Well Fed（飽食強化）- 製作更強大的食物：透過合併不同食材來製成大份食物，減少進食頻率</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/sulfur-and-potassium-make-more-gunpowder\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Sulfur and Potassium（硫磺與鉀）- 一種對原版友好的火藥合成方式</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/lamp-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Lamp Block（燈飾方塊）- 僅是一個會持續發光的紅石燈，讓你不用掛醜陋的開關就能製造照明燈具</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f321663%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253danders%2540minaemail.se%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f321663%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dEnhanced%2bMob%2bSpawners%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LOz2nLA.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f318696%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253danders%2540minaemail.se%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f318696%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dWell%2bFed%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">咖啡贊助罐</a> - 支持我與模組的最佳方式。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝大家遊玩我的模組，並提供咖啡贊助！</p>",
